    "detailed_description": "You can move with the arrow keys on your keyboard, and you can upgrade the player's abilities by pressing the &quot;Esc&quot; button.<br />\r\nYou can interact with NPCs, treasure chests, etc. with the space bar, and press the Z key to attack.<br />\r\nDepending on the attack power, there are a total of 4 stages of attack.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is cleared by upgrading the player by catching treasure chests and monsters that are continuously created, and by catching the final boss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove freely and find treasure chests.<br />\r\nTreasure chests are hidden all over the map.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlong with simple quests, NPCs will tell you how to play and in which direction to play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpgrade your players with coins obtained by finding treasure chests or defeating enemies.<br />\r\nThe player's attack is upgraded according to the attack power.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nItems you get can be converted into coins through NPCs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are simple labyrinths and areas blocked by invisible walls on the map, which can be solved through interaction.",
